{"id":"wb-6-329","name":"正定府文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"正定府文庙","text":"正定府文庙，即正定府学文庙，位于中国河北省正定县老城内的常山东路路南正定县中医院南方、县学门口街东头解放街小学北侧的居民区中。正定设府的历史长达1131年，因此正定内同时有府、县两级学宫文庙。县学文庙目前保存尚好，府学文庙则仅剩戟门及其东西耳房，是建于元代的珍贵文物。2006年成为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%9A%E5%BA%9C%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":84931852,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84931852","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/19d0bff5ccec099aa52d16fd.jpg","title":"正定府文庙,_2020-09-06.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%9A%E5%BA%9C%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99,_2020-09-06.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%9A%E5%BA%9C%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99%2C_2020-09-06.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​正定府文庙戟门","width":320,"height":214}}